{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026omCKNEPpQc1795663074.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港中旅以介紹形式分拆的中旅港澳首日掛牌。</p><p></p><p>開報2.2元，每手買賣單位為500股，不涉及發行新股或集資。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO-1000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SeTqvSsuEY1795663071.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>香港中旅已於周一批准及宣布，向合資格股東進行實物分派，合資格股東每持有4股香港中旅股份可獲分派1股中旅港澳股份，以實物分派方式支付。而透過滬港通及深股通持有香港中旅的股東，也可以獲得分派。</p><p></p><p>中旅港澳主要從事酒店，跨境客運及旅行證件服務等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:20:21.277730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:17:16.827554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T04:13:45.569960+00:00","content_hash":"574051640d3d78b8695d35b20fa7f3e97788324ad38b382cb4f710798b1ef289","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:20:21.277730+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}